      <div className="animate-rise-in"><div className="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1.5 font-mono-brand text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-accent"><span className="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent" /> Ghana, meet home</div><h1 className="max-w-xl font-display text-[clamp(3.4rem,8vw,6.8rem)] font-semibold leading-[.93] tracking-[-.065em] text-cream">A place to land.<br /><em className="text-primary not-italic">A way forward.</em></h1><p className="mt-7 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-cream/65">Verified long-term homes across Ghana, with honest prices and a rental journey that moves at your pace.</p><div className="mt-9 max-w-2xl"><SearchBar /></div><div className="mt-5 flex items-center gap-5 text-xs text-cream/45"><span className="flex items-center gap-1.5"><ShieldCheck size={14} className="text-accent" /> Every listing reviewed</span><span className="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Zap size={14} className="text-accent" /> Built for Ghana</span></div></div>
